# Files that ship in the package and run or are copied as-is keep LF on every checkout.
# With core.autocrlf on Windows they would otherwise get CRLF: pnpm refuses a bin whose
# shebang ends in CRLF (ERR_PNPM_BIN_CRLF), and `npx fenrir-ts create` would copy CRLF files.
bin/** text eol=lf
templates/** text eol=lf
*.png binary
